      "title": "🔍 Guide: 4K Bilateral Panorama Upscaler (RealESRGAN 2x + Edge-Preserving Denoise)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ✨ 4K 360° Panorama Bilateral Upscaler\n\nSubtle edge-preserving noise cleanup for ultra-clean **4K ($4096 \\times 2048$)** VR skyboxes without dotted artifacts!\n\n---\n\n### 🔄 Complete Pipeline Architecture\n`2K Pano` $\\to$ **`5% Toroidal Wrap`** $\\to$ **`RealESRGAN 2×`** $\\to$ **`Bilateral Filter`** $\\to$ **`Crop Padding`** $\\to$ **`Final 4K`**\n\n1. **Input 2K Panorama**: Loads your generated $2048 \\times 1024$ equirectangular image.\n2. **5% Toroidal Margin Wrapping**: Left and right margins wrap circularly before upscaling and filtering, guaranteeing zero vertical stitch lines across $0^\\circ / 360^\\circ$.\n3. **RealESRGAN 2× Super-Resolution**: Upscales $2048 \\times 1024 \\to 4096 \\times 2048$ with sharp structural edges.\n4. **Subtle Edge-Preserving Bilateral Cleanup**: Gently smooths out high-frequency noise and dotted speckles while strictly maintaining crisp architectural edges, horizons, and high-contrast lines.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Critical Tuning Guidelines: Use It Lightly!\nIf bilateral filtering is pushed too aggressively, the image can quickly become:\n• **Plasticky / waxy**\n• **Painterly / cartoonish**\n• **Unnaturally smoothed / losing texture depth**\n\nTreat it as a **subtle cleanup**, not a heavy denoise pass!\n\n**Recommended Mild Starting Point (Default)**:\n• **`d` = 5**: Diameter of pixel neighborhood (keep small for subtle cleanup).\n• **`sigma_color` = 15.0** (Recommended range: 10 to 20): Controls how colors are mixed. Smaller values preserve natural micro-textures.\n• **`sigma_space` = 4.0** (Recommended range: 3 to 5): Spatial distance influence.\n• **`blend_opacity` = 1.0**: (Can dial down to 0.70–0.85 if you want an even gentler touch).\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Fast A/B Comparison\n• Click on **[Step 2: Subtle Bilateral Filter]** and press **`Ctrl + M`** to instantly **Mute / Bypass** it.\n• You can compare the raw RealESRGAN 2× output directly with the bilateral-cleaned output in the side-by-side preview windows!"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# ✨ 4K 360° Panorama Bilateral Upscaler\n\n• Pipeline: 2K -> 5% Wrap -> RealESRGAN 2x -> Bilateral Filter -> Crop -> Final 4K\n• Mild settings: d=5, sigmaColor=10-20, sigmaSpace=3-5\n• 100% Seamless 360 Toroidal Boundary Wrap"
      },
      "color": "#1f2a3a",
      "bgcolor": "#121a24"
    },
